<body>

<h1>🌌 SPACE INFORMATION</h1>
<p>Explore the planets of our Solar System</p>

<div class="planet">
<h2>☿ Mercury</h2>
<p>Near the Sun, but not the hottest planet.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>♀ Venus</h2>
<p>The hottest planet in our Solar System.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>🌍 Earth</h2>
<p>The living planet and home to humans.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>♃ Jupiter</h2>
<p>A giant planet with a massive red spot.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>🪐 Saturn</h2>
<p>A beautiful planet famous for its huge rings.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>♅ Uranus</h2>
<p>A blue-green planet that rotates on its side.</p>
</div>

<div class="planet">
<h2>♆ Neptune</h2>
<p>The farthest planet from the Sun.</p>
</div>

